   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Control flow moves to line 9, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">park_greet()</code> is called. Which line does control flow move to next?\n<pre class=\"python line-numbering\" data-lang=\"python\">def extra_lot():\n&nbsp;&nbsp;# Function definition\n\ndef park_greet():\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\"\"\"Output greeting.\"\"\"\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(\"Welcome. Open sunrise to sunset.\")\n\ncar_count = 1\npark_greet()\nif car_count &gt; 50:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;extra_lot()\n</pre>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328646,
     "content_html": "1",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "extra_lot() is defined at line 1, but park_greet() is called. So control flow moves to where park_greet() is defined."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328647,
     "content_html": "4",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "Control flow moves to where <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">park_greet()</code> is defined, at line 4."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328648,
     "content_html": "10",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "Control flow does not continue to line 10 until after park_greet() is executed. Control flow moves to where park_greet() is defined"
    }
